{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞洲職業匹克球巡迴賽，首日在啟德體藝館舉行資格賽。<br/></p><p>大會在體藝館內設置了24個匹克球賽場。資格賽朝九晚九進行，每名職業組球手要在近3至4輪的比拼中勝出，晉級明天的64強賽事。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PICKLEBALL-1130.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qKm75uaREp1792385428.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>一連7日的巡迴賽，匯聚來自22個國家及地區，共895名球手，其中世界前6球手全部參賽，競逐110萬美元、折合約850萬港元總獎金，金額為同類賽事中最高，亦有1,500點排名積分。周日舉行決賽。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PICKLEBALL-1130_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Xx8gOgkB4M1792385422.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:39:47.246020+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:17:56.112673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:38:14.323824+00:00","content_hash":"65ecbe2391833e0637c640816182ac8379cee36998ce14f51a6824851faba7b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}